    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "20. Strategic Reserves",
    "ruleNumber": "20.01",
    "summary": "When declaring battle formations, you can put 1 or more of your units, except **FORTIFICATIONS**, into **strategic reserves**. They are set aside instead of deployed and enter play later.\n\nUnless a rule says otherwise, your strategic reserves units may total at most 50% of your battle size's points limit, counting units embarked in **TRANSPORTS** that are themselves in reserves.",
